From 59ae6d8ab059991d113eb34cf83b58987e324701 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 03:42:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Instanced regions: REBUILD_REGION, InstanceMap, rotated
 zone-template copies, instance_* commands

Groundwork for Construction. An instance is a 16x16-zone block at x/z 6400+ whose zones are
copies of template zones (collision + locs, rotated with the client's own WorldRegion maths);
players inside get REBUILD_REGION. Server collision verified tile-for-tile against the client's
instanced scene build, including a room replaced and a room cleared after the first build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
